&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:14px"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:arial nova light,arial nova light_embeddedfont,arial nova light_msfontservice,sans-serif"&gt;Muniz was medically cleared at Salem Hospital before being lodged at the Marion County Jail on charges of Robbery in the First Degree, Assault in the Second Degree, Unlawful Use of a Weapon, and Criminal Mischief.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:arial nova light,arial nova light_embeddedfont,arial nova light_msfontservice,sans-serif"&gt;&amp;nbsp;He is scheduled to be&amp;nbsp;arraigned&amp;nbsp;at 2:30 p.m. today at the Marion County Court Annex at 4000 Aumsville Highway.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:arial nova light,arial nova light_embeddedfont,arial nova light_msfontservice,sans-serif"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

