&lt;p style="margin-left: 40px;"&gt;To support a solo exhibition at Pendleton Center for the Arts Gallery for the month of June in 2026.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style="margin-left: 40px;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

