&lt;p style="margin-left: 40px;"&gt;To support expenses related to an exhibition opportunity at NOON Projects in Los Angeles, California, opening in April 2026. The exhibition is a two-person show featuring Kennedy&rsquo;s work alongside that of Marcus Fischer.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style="margin-left: 40px;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

