&lt;p style="margin-left: 40px;"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Oregon Arts Commission, $1,500&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style="margin-left: 40px;"&gt;To support Lincoln&rsquo;s participation in the competitive, invite-only Centrum Artist in Residency Program in January, 2026.&lt;/p&gt;

