&lt;p style="margin-left: 40px;"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Oregon Arts Commission, $2,000&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style="margin-left: 40px;"&gt;To support a three-month residency in Sevilla, Spain, in early 2026 to study cante jondo at the Fundaci&oacute;n Cristina Heeren, expanding Lopez&rsquo;s vocal artistry while weaving his professional practice with the deep currents of his Andalusian heritage.&lt;/p&gt;

