&lt;p style="margin-left: 40px;"&gt;To support a meaningful step in Van Norman&rsquo;s career, he will moderate a panel discussion, display his print &ldquo;Rhapsody in Gray&rdquo; and conduct a printmaking demonstration. Van Norman will also network with research, industry and community leaders at the State of the Coast Conference in November 2025.&lt;/p&gt;

