&lt;p&gt;Kaiya is described as a female, approximately 4 feet 9 inches tall, with a medium build and dark, curly hair. She was last seen wearing a black baggy sweatshirt with &ldquo;USA&rdquo; on the sleeve and blue jeans.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

